e</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Pallavi Ngo</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Human Resources</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Privacy Consultant (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Kanchana Kilic</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Chief Diversity Officer</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Actuary (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Georg Graves</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Senior Manager of Procurement Strategy</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Co-Chair</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Succession Planning Report — Kincaid Walsh Partners Executive Team</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Succession Planning Report — Kincaid Walsh Partners Executive Team was a review of the company&#x27;s compliance with copyright laws. The committee reviewed the company&#x27;s content portfolio and confirmed that it was in compliance.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for profitability:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Board Strategy Offsite Planning Committee defers consideration of the Succession Planning Report — Kincaid Walsh Partners Executive Team to the next scheduled meeting, pending receipt of additional analysis from the responsible owner.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Abebe Gitau &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Georg Graves</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 6 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Customer Advisory Board Feedback Summary</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Tanvi Dizon led the discussion on the Customer Advisory Board Feedback Summary, highlighting the recent performance data for the Video Streaming Services sector. The committee noted the 11% deviation from the forecast and debated potential corrective measures. The consensus was to adopt a phased approach, as outlined in the revised proposal. A formal vote followed.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To amend:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Board Strategy Offsite Planning Committee approves the public disclosure of the Customer Advisory Board Feedback Summary in the company&#x27;s upcoming proxy statement.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Abebe Gitau &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Pallavi Ngo</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 6 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Data Privacy Impact Assessment (DPIA) Report</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The {item_title} was presented by {presenter}, who outlined the proposed changes to the company&#x27;s compensation philosophy. The committee debated the merits of moving to a more aggressive market positioning and ultimately approved a shift to the 75th percentile for critical roles.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for talent attraction:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Board Strategy Offsite Planning Committee hereby approves the Data Privacy Impact Assessment (DPIA) Report as presented, effective 2010-12-14, and authorizes the designated owner to take all actions necessary to implement the foregoing.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Oluwakemi Dutta &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Georg Graves</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 6 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Review the company&#x27;s compliance with the latest data privacy laws (GDPR, CCPA)</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Brigitte Yang</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2011-01-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Conduct a review of the company&#x27;s supply chain resilience</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Rhonda Gonzales</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2011-01-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Develop a training module for managers on the new performance management process</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Veronique Rauf</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2011-01-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">4</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a presentation on the company&#x27;s cybersecurity posture</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Alon Cowan</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2011-01-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">5</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Review the company&#x27;s compliance with new pay transparency laws in 6 states</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Fitri Johnson</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2011-01-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 5:45 PM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 2011-01-08</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Georg Graves</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Senior Manager of Procurement Strategy, Co-Chair</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Signature</div></div><div><div style=\"width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Approved: ___________</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><a href=\"/archive/2010/12/13/technology-risk-assessment-3517/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/2010/12/14/vendor-contract-renewal-3345/advance-notice-bylaw-and-universal-proxy-preparedness-4441/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:n